IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. ENVIRONMENT DIVISION. INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION. FILE-CONTROL. SELECT F ASSIGN TO 'a'. DATA DIVISION. FILE SECTION. FD F. 01 R PIC X. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256). 01 W PIC X VALUE '1'. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY 'OK'.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'OK' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "OK"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [OK] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN.

